meta {
  name: PUT /api/visits/{visit_id}/routing
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

put {
  url: {{hisBaseUrl}}/api/visits/{{visit_id}}/routing
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{hisToken}}
  X-API-Key: {{hisToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "department": "string",
    "complaint": "string",
    "illness_note": "string",
    "confirmed_by": "string",
    "rerouted": false
  }
}

docs {
  WE PUT — Stage 2 write-back: nurse-confirmed department routing (HttpHisAdapter.confirm_routing). Real-iMed counterpart: POST /patient-assignments.
  
  Stage 2 write-back — publish the clinical narrative + routing.
  
  Human sign-off. Promotes the held complaint summary + reason into the
  nurse_* fields and writes second_location (the confirmed/rerouted
  department) onto the visit row.
}
